  (text_box "Missing:\nPyro N-Ch MOSFET PMPB10NX\nFuses everywhere\nAnother voltage regulator for servos, ematches (pyro), etc) for ex: 5v 4a tps621361rgxt\nSome leds like (each sensor power, each pyro etc)\nCameras pins\nBuzzer\nHigh and low side mosfets for pyro channels power\nN-Ch MOSFET PMPB10NX and si4143dy-t1-ge3\nTelemetry"
